2026-07-27T14:45:29.0920636Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:45:29.0920966Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:45:29.0921423Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:45:29.0922051Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:45:29.0922904Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
